            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"l01-setup-and-your-first-program\">L01: Setup and your first program</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>By the end of this lecture you can:</strong></span>\n<ul>\n<li>install Python with uv and run a program</li>\n<li>use the Python REPL as a calculator</li>\n<li>save your work with git</li>\n<li>ask an AI to explain an error message</li>\n</ul></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
