            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"1-install-uv\">1. Install uv</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">uv installs Python and every library this course needs. You never install Python by hand.</span>\n<div class=\"language-sh codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"c1\"># macOS / Linux</span>\ncurl<span class=\"w\"> </span>-LsSf<span class=\"w\"> </span>https://astral.sh/uv/install.sh<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>sh\n<span class=\"c1\"># Windows (PowerShell)</span>\npowershell<span class=\"w\"> </span>-ExecutionPolicy<span class=\"w\"> </span>ByPass<span class=\"w\"> </span>-c<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"irm https://astral.sh/uv/install.ps1 | iex\"</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Then check that it works:</span>\n<div class=\"language-sh codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code>uv<span class=\"w\"> </span>--version\nuv<span class=\"w\"> </span>run<span class=\"w\"> </span>python<span class=\"w\"> </span>--version<span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"c1\"># downloads Python 3.15 the first time</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"2-the-repl\">2. The REPL</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><code>uv run python</code> starts the <strong>REPL</strong> (Read\u2013Eval\u2013Print Loop). You type an expression and Python prints its value. Type <code>exit</code> to leave.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Predict:</strong> what does each line below print?</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
