            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"3-your-first-program\">3. Your first program</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">A program is a file of instructions that Python runs from top to bottom. Save this as <code>hello.py</code>, then run <code>uv run python hello.py</code>.</span></span>"
          }
        }
