            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"ai-activity-your-first-conversation\">AI activity: your first conversation</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>In the REPL, run <code>print(\"Total: \" + 5)</code> and copy the full error.</li>\n<li>Ask an AI: <em>\"I'm a beginner. Explain this Python error in plain English, but don't fix my code: \u2026\"</em></li>\n<li>Fix it yourself. Write one sentence in your own words about what went wrong.</li>\n</ol>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Exercises:</strong> open <code>l01_exercises.py</code>, then run <code>uv run pytest lectures/01-setup</code>.</span></span>"
